<title>USA: SOCCER-LOS ANGELES GALAXY BEAT SANTOS LAGUNA OF MEXICO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LOS ANGELES GALAXY BEAT SANTOS LAGUNA OF MEXICO.</headline>
<dateline>PASADENA, California 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The MLS' Los</p>
<p>Angeles Galaxy beat Santos Laguna AC of Mexico 4-1 (halftime</p>
<p>0-0) at the Rose Bowl Wednesday in a match for a berth in the</p>
<p>CONCACAF Champions' Cup tournament.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Los Angeles Galaxy - Mauricio Cienfuegos (64th minute),</p>
<p>Eduardo Hurtado (65), Martin Machon (80), Welton (84)</p>
<p>Santos Laguna - Nicolas Ramirez (70)</p>
<p>Attendance: 10,271</p>
</text>
